cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (this file) and the associated journal article."
title: "Bani Suef irrigation-suitability digital-soil-mapping repository"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipeline coupling quantile-random-forest digital soil
  mapping, Monte Carlo Sys–Verheye ALES-Arid land evaluation, and counterfactual
  gap decomposition over the Beni Suef alluvial floodplain (Middle Egypt).
  Independent ground-truth validation against a 993-point Sentinel-2 cropland
  survey (March 2025) is included, together with the revision stages added for
  Geoderma Regional R1: a structural sensitivity analysis of the rating index, a
  Gaussian-copula variant of the uncertainty propagation, quantification of the
  crop-survey sampling bias, and an independent comparison against FAO WaPOR v3
  transpiration, evapotranspiration and biomass fields.
type: software
